msgid ""
"Arrow keys move through the list, Enter chooses, Escape closes it. "
"Without JavaScript it is a plain select, which is why a list must fit in "
"a page."
msgstr ""
"Las flechas recorren la lista, Intro elige y Escape la cierra. Sin "
"JavaScript es un select normal, y por eso la lista debe caber en una "
"página."

